            <title>Flux (beta) 1.0.0-beta.2</title>
            <sparkle:releaseNotes><![CDATA[
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: dark light;
    --card-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    --card-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    --text-primary: #F0F3F6;
    --text-secondary: #9DA7B3;
    --accent: #58A6FF;
    --accent-bg: rgba(88, 166, 255, 0.12);
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: light) {
    :root {
      --card-bg: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
      --card-border: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      --text-primary: #1F2328;
      --text-secondary: #57606A;
      --accent: #0969DA;
      --accent-bg: rgba(9, 105, 218, 0.1);
    }
  }
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "SF Pro Text", "SF Pro Display", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    background: transparent;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 10px 14px 20px 14px;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  .header-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  }
  .version-title {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.2px;
  }
  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--accent-bg);
    color: var(--accent);
    border: 1px solid rgba(88, 166, 255, 0.3);
  }
  .card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 11px 13px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .card-header .icon {
    margin-right: 7px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 18px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  li {
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  li strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header-card">
    <div class="version-title">Flux 1.0.0-beta.2</div>
    <div class="badge">Beta Release</div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-header"><span class="icon">🎨</span> Video Quality &amp; SDR Color Calibration</div>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Deep True Blacks:</strong> Resolved lifted gray levels and color quantization banding on SDR displays by switching to standard 32-bit RGBA CGL framebuffer.</li>
      <li><strong>Reference EDR Gating:</strong> Display color pipeline now matches standalone <code>mpv</code> and native macOS sRGB color spaces 1:1.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-header"><span class="icon">🔊</span> 5.1 Multichannel Audio Stability</div>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Zero CoreAudio Crashes:</strong> Switched audio output driver ladder to <code>avfoundation,coreaudio</code> with <code>auto-safe</code> channel negotiation.</li>
      <li><strong>Seamless Downmix:</strong> 6-channel surround sound downmixes smoothly to MacBook speakers without AudioUnit layout failures.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-header"><span class="icon">⏱️</span> Seamless Next-Episode Countdown</div>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Early Credits Detection:</strong> Next episode prompt appears early as soon as credits roll (~90s remaining or 92% progress).</li>
      <li><strong>Relaxed Countdown:</strong> Extended auto-play timer to 90 seconds with an animated circular progress ring.</li>
      <li><strong>Clean Episode Starts:</strong> Next episodes start strictly at 0:00 without inheriting prior seek positions.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-header"><span class="icon">🎬</span> Movie Credits &amp; Bi-Directional Toggle</div>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Interactive Overlays:</strong> Clicking the player reveals controls while smoothly dismissing suggestions; hiding controls automatically returns suggestions.</li>
      <li><strong>Watch Credits Mode:</strong> Added dedicated button to enjoy end-credits scenes unobstructed, plus a floating <em>Related</em> glass pill to restore suggestions on demand.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-header"><span class="icon">🧩</span> WebStore &amp; PenguPlay Integration</div>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>One-Click Setup:</strong> Prominent <em>Setup &amp; Install</em> button directs users to account configuration on <code>pengu.uk</code>.</li>
      <li><strong>Smart Detection:</strong> Accurately detects and badges installed PenguPlay instances.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-header"><span class="icon">🛡️</span> Library Safety &amp; Production Bridge</div>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Automatic Migration:</strong> Seamlessly imports watch history, watchlist, collections, and personal TMDB API keys from the production bundle into the beta channel.</li>
      <li><strong>PocketBase Cloud Sync:</strong> Automatically verifies and syncs restored library records to the cloud.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</body>
